      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_02",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아, 그, 그렇죠! 함께하는 훈련이니까…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あ～あは！そ、そうですよね！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 39,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_02",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitMotion": "SAD",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "죄송합니다! 제가 생각이 짧았습니다!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "申し訳ございません！私の考えが至らないばかりに！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 40,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_02",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "모자란 만큼은 훈련 끝나고 스스로 할 테니 걱정 안 하셔도 됩니다!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "足りない分は訓練後に一人でしますので！お気になさらないでください！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 41,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_02",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "하지만 이대로는 언제나 훈련에 아쉬움을 느끼겠지.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "しかし、このままでは訓練の度に残念な気持ちになるだろう。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 42,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_02",
